{"seq":3,"slug":"lora-and-lpwan","title":"LoRa 与 LPWAN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/lora-and-lpwan","wordCount":888,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lora-与-lpwan\">LoRa 与 LPWAN</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LPWAN（Low-Power Wide-Area Network）是专为 IoT 设计的长距离低功耗广域网技术。LoRa（Long Range）是 LPWAN 领域最主流的物理层调制技术，结合 LoRaWAN 网络协议，可在数公里范围内以极低功耗传输少量数据。LPWAN 填补了 BLE（近距离）和蜂窝网络（高功耗）之间的空白，是智慧城市、农业监测、资产追踪等场景的核心连接技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[IoT 连接技术谱] --&gt; B[近距离]&#10;    A --&gt; C[中距离]&#10;    A --&gt; D[远距离]&#10;    B --&gt; E[BLE 10-100m]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Zigbee 10-100m]&#10;    C --&gt; G[WiFi 50-100m]&#10;    D --&gt; H[LoRa 2-15km]&#10;    D --&gt; I[NB-IoT 10-35km]&#10;    D --&gt; J[Sigfox 10-50km]\">graph TD\n    A[IoT 连接技术谱] --&gt; B[近距离]\n    A --&gt; C[中距离]\n    A --&gt; D[远距离]\n    B --&gt; E[BLE 10-100m]\n    B --&gt; F[Zigbee 10-100m]\n    C --&gt; G[WiFi 50-100m]\n    D --&gt; H[LoRa 2-15km]\n    D --&gt; I[NB-IoT 10-35km]\n    D --&gt; J[Sigfox 10-50km]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>距离</th>\n<th>速率</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>授权</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRa</td>\n<td>2-15km</td>\n<td>0.3-50Kbps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>ISM 非授权</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n<td>遥测、追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NB-IoT</td>\n<td>10-35km</td>\n<td>60-250Kbps</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>授权频段</td>\n<td>运营商</td>\n<td>抄表、城市基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sigfox</td>\n<td>10-50km</td>\n<td>100-600bps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>ISM 非授权</td>\n<td>Sigfox 网络</td>\n<td>极简遥测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTE-M</td>\n<td>10-35km</td>\n<td>1Mbps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>授权频段</td>\n<td>运营商</td>\n<td>移动资产追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lora-物理层\">LoRa 物理层</h2><p>LoRa 使用啁啾扩频（Chirp Spread Spectrum, CSS）调制技术，通过扩频因子（Spreading Factor, SF）在数据速率和传输距离之间做权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// LoRa 射频参数配置（SX1276/SX1262）&#10;SX1276_SetChannel(868100000);           // 频率 868.1MHz (EU868)&#10;SX1276_SetSpreadingFactor(LORA_SF7);    // 扩频因子 SF7&#10;SX1276_SetBandwidth(LORA_BW_125);       // 带宽 125KHz&#10;SX1276_SetCodingRate(LORA_CR_4_5);      // 编码率 4/5&#10;SX1276_SetTxPower(14);                  // 发射功率 14dBm&#10;&#10;// 发送数据&#10;uint8_t payload[] = {0x01, 0x02, 0x03};&#10;SX1276_Send(payload, sizeof(payload));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LoRa 射频参数配置（SX1276/SX1262）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_SetChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">868100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 频率 868.1MHz (EU868)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_SetSpreadingFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LORA_SF7);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 扩频因子 SF7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_SetBandwidth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LORA_BW_125);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 带宽 125KHz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_SetCodingRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LORA_CR_4_5);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 编码率 4/5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_SetTxPower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // 发射功率 14dBm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发送数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SX1276_Send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload));</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SF</th>\n<th>速率 (125KHz BW)</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>空中时间 (10 Bytes)</th>\n<th>距离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SF7</td>\n<td>5.47 Kbps</td>\n<td>-123 dBm</td>\n<td>36ms</td>\n<td>2-5km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF8</td>\n<td>3.13 Kbps</td>\n<td>-126 dBm</td>\n<td>72ms</td>\n<td>3-7km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF9</td>\n<td>1.76 Kbps</td>\n<td>-129 dBm</td>\n<td>144ms</td>\n<td>4-9km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF10</td>\n<td>0.98 Kbps</td>\n<td>-132 dBm</td>\n<td>288ms</td>\n<td>5-11km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF11</td>\n<td>0.54 Kbps</td>\n<td>-134.5 dBm</td>\n<td>577ms</td>\n<td>6-13km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF12</td>\n<td>0.29 Kbps</td>\n<td>-137 dBm</td>\n<td>1155ms</td>\n<td>7-15km</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SF 每增加 1，灵敏度提升约 2.5dB（距离约增加 30%），但空中时间翻倍（功耗翻倍）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lorawan-网络架构\">LoRaWAN 网络架构</h2><p>LoRaWAN 定义了端设备、网关和网络服务器之间的网络协议：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa RF| B[网关 1]&#10;    A --&gt;|LoRa RF| C[网关 2]&#10;    B --&gt;|IP 网络| D[网络服务器]&#10;    C --&gt;|IP 网络| D&#10;    D --&gt; E[应用服务器]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Join 服务器]\">graph LR\n    A[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa RF| B[网关 1]\n    A --&gt;|LoRa RF| C[网关 2]\n    B --&gt;|IP 网络| D[网络服务器]\n    C --&gt;|IP 网络| D\n    D --&gt; E[应用服务器]\n    D --&gt; F[Join 服务器]</pre><p><strong>LoRaWAN 设备类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>接收窗口</th>\n<th>下行延迟</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Class A</td>\n<td>上行后两个窗口</td>\n<td>不确定（需等上行）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>传感器遥测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class B</td>\n<td>定时信标窗口</td>\n<td>可预测（128s 周期内）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>定时检查命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class C</td>\n<td>持续接收</td>\n<td>几乎实时</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>路灯、常供电设备</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>入网方式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// OTAA (Over-The-Air Activation) — 推荐&#10;// 设备存储 DevEUI + AppEUI + AppKey&#10;// 通过 Join Request/Accept 动态获取 DevAddr 和会话密钥&#10;uint8_t devEui[8] = {0x01, 0x02, ...};&#10;uint8_t appEui[8] = {0x01, 0x02, ...};&#10;uint8_t appKey[16] = {0xAB, 0xCD, ...};&#10;&#10;// ABP (Activation By Personalization) — 简化&#10;// 设备预置 DevAddr + NwkSKey + AppSKey&#10;// 无需入网流程，但安全性较低\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// OTAA (Over-The-Air Activation) — 推荐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设备存储 DevEUI + AppEUI + AppKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 Join Request/Accept 动态获取 DevAddr 和会话密钥</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> devEui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ...};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> appEui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ...};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> appKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ...};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ABP (Activation By Personalization) — 简化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设备预置 DevAddr + NwkSKey + AppSKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 无需入网流程，但安全性较低</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"频率规划与合规\">频率规划与合规</h2><p>不同地区使用不同的 ISM 频段，LoRaWAN 区域参数规范定义了各区域的合规要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>信道数</th>\n<th>占空比限制</th>\n<th>发射功率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EU868</td>\n<td>868 MHz</td>\n<td>8+1</td>\n<td>1%（0.1%-10%）</td>\n<td>14/27 dBm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>US915</td>\n<td>915 MHz</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>无占空比限制</td>\n<td>30 dBm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CN470</td>\n<td>470 MHz</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>无占空比限制</td>\n<td>19.15 dBm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AU915</td>\n<td>915 MHz</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>无占空比限制</td>\n<td>30 dBm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AS923</td>\n<td>923 MHz</td>\n<td>8+</td>\n<td>取决于子区域</td>\n<td>16 dBm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nb-iot-对比与选型\">NB-IoT 对比与选型</h2><p>NB-IoT（Narrowband IoT）是 3GPP 标准的蜂窝 LPWAN 技术，使用授权频段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LoRa/LoRaWAN</th>\n<th>NB-IoT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署方式</td>\n<td>自建网关</td>\n<td>运营商基站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频段</td>\n<td>非授权 ISM</td>\n<td>授权蜂窝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次通信成本</td>\n<td>极低（自有网络）</td>\n<td>按流量计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施投入</td>\n<td>网关 + 服务器</td>\n<td>无（运营商覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动性</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>支持（蜂窝切换）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下行能力</td>\n<td>受限（Class A）</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QoS</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>运营商 SLA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>室内穿透</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>极好（低频段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>应用层加密</td>\n<td>SIM 卡 + 蜂窝安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选型指南</strong>：自有场地或农村部署选 LoRa（自建网关，无月租）；城市部署需要运营商覆盖选 NB-IoT。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LPWAN 填补了短距离（BLE/Zigbee）和蜂窝（4G/5G）之间的 IoT 连接空白</li>\n<li>LoRa 使用啁啾扩频调制，SF 越高距离越远但速率越低、功耗越高</li>\n<li>LoRaWAN 分为 Class A/B/C 三种设备类型，Class A 功耗最低但下行受限</li>\n<li>OTAA 入网方式比 ABP 更安全，支持动态密钥协商</li>\n<li>频率规划需遵守当地 ISM 频段法规，EU868 有严格的占空比限制</li>\n<li>LoRa 适合自建网络场景（农业、工厂），NB-IoT 适合城市覆盖和运营商管理场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LoRa 与 LPWAN","id":"lora-与-lpwan"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LoRa 物理层","id":"lora-物理层"},{"level":2,"text":"LoRaWAN 网络架构","id":"lorawan-网络架构"},{"level":2,"text":"频率规划与合规","id":"频率规划与合规"},{"level":2,"text":"NB-IoT 对比与选型","id":"nb-iot-对比与选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"BLE 蓝牙低功耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/ble-bluetooth-low-energy"},"next":{"title":"IoT 安全与边缘计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/iot-security-edge-computing"}}